    "INDEPENDENT_QUALIFIED_CASE": "A human-reviewed, task-valid candidate whose evidence supports a non-invalid label and whose independence cluster is not already counted. AMBIGUOUS is qualified for review/uncertainty analysis but does not contribute to either class floor."
